ComfyUI-MiniMaxH3-OneNode
Copyright 2026 The New Game Plus

This Apache-2.0 project is a graph-building user interface for MiniMax H3 in
ComfyUI. It does not reimplement MiniMax H3 and does not include model weights.

CORE UPSTREAM PROJECTS

- ComfyUI and its native MiniMax H3, video, audio, sampler, mask, and AV latent
  nodes: https://github.com/Comfy-Org/ComfyUI
- MiniMax H3 model, architecture, documentation, and prompt-writing guidance:
  https://github.com/MiniMax-AI/MiniMax-H3
- ComfyUI-ready H3 model files:
  https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3
- Qwen3-VL encoder family:
  https://github.com/QwenLM/Qwen3-VL

MiniMax H3 weights and associated upstream material remain subject to the MiniMax
H3 Community License Agreement and any terms on their model cards. Model weights
are not bundled with this repository.

