BUNDLED PROMPT MATERIAL

Files under prompt_guides/official_minimax are pinned upstream MiniMax H3
prompt-writing material. The exact source revision and hashes are recorded in
prompt_guides/official_minimax/SOURCES.md. No ownership of that upstream material
is asserted.

PRIVACY

The public release does not include model weights, full-resolution renders, API
tokens, machine-specific paths, render favorites, or user settings. The compressed
README demo GIF and three promotional stills are derived from the author's
already-public YouTube render. Runtime settings are stored separately by ComfyUI.

Use responsibly. Obtain appropriate rights and consent for reference media, voice,
identity, and generated content. This project is not affiliated with MiniMax,
Comfy-Org, NVIDIA, or the optional companion projects.
